* ---- VM/370 directory entry for the CHATBOT service machine ----------
* (add to the system directory, adjust passwords, volumes and sizes)
USER CHATBOT CHANGE_ME 3M 4M G
 ACCOUNT 1 CHATBOT
 OPTION ECMODE
 IPL CMS
 CONSOLE 009 3215
 SPOOL 00C 2540 READER A
 SPOOL 00D 2540 PUNCH A
 SPOOL 00E 1403 A
 LINK MAINT 190 190 RR
 LINK MAINT 19E 19E RR
 MDISK 191 3330 000 010 VMDSK1 MR
*
* AUTOLOG at IPL: add to the system's start-up (e.g. the operator's
* PROFILE or a 'CP XAUTOLOG CHATBOT' line):
*     CP XAUTOLOG CHATBOT
* Anything that arrives in CHATBOT's reader while it is logged off is
* answered when it starts: PROFILE EXEC ends in EXEC CHATBOT.
* Let users punch to it freely:  no privilege class is needed for
*     SPOOL PUNCH TO CHATBOT
